      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "connect     → LoadSymbolTableAsync\n   libplctag opens no socket until a handle is first\n   read, so the browse is what a connect establishes\n   — and the proof the controller answers CIP.\n   A failure arrives as ConnectionFailureException.\n\ndisconnect → Drain\n   frees every handle, drops the definitions. Reversible.\n\ndispose      → Dispose\n   terminal. A handle left to its finalizer fail-fasts\n   the process at CLR teardown (0xC0000602).",
      "rawText": "connect     → LoadSymbolTableAsync\n   libplctag opens no socket until a handle is first\n   read, so the browse is what a connect establishes\n   — and the proof the controller answers CIP.\n   A failure arrives as ConnectionFailureException.\n\ndisconnect → Drain\n   frees every handle, drops the definitions. Reversible.\n\ndispose      → Dispose\n   terminal. A handle left to its finalizer fail-fasts\n   the process at CLR teardown (0xC0000602).",
      "originalText": "connect     → LoadSymbolTableAsync\n   libplctag opens no socket until a handle is first\n   read, so the browse is what a connect establishes\n   — and the proof the controller answers CIP.\n   A failure arrives as ConnectionFailureException.\n\ndisconnect → Drain\n   frees every handle, drops the definitions. Reversible.\n\ndispose      → Dispose\n   terminal. A handle left to its finalizer fail-fasts\n   the process at CLR teardown (0xC0000602).",
